# vein.discovery — what `$`, `#`, `@`, `&` and `*` ENUMERATE in this sample.
#
# `samples/vein.discovery` one directory up says `silent all`; this file overrides it here.
#
# ALL THREE KITS ARE EXPOSED: type `@` in band.vein and the list shows `@Strum` three times, once
# per owner, each row naming the bundle it came from.

silent all

expose Vein.Console        # `@Print`
expose alice.Guitar        # one `@Strum`
expose bob.Banjo           # another
expose carol.Harp          # and the third
